# Cloudflare Pages SPA fallback.
#
# The app is a single-page React app: `/register`, `/display/<id>`, `/staff/...`
# are client-side routes with no file behind them. Cloudflare serves a matching
# static file first, so real assets are unaffected; anything else is rewritten
# to index.html and React Router takes over.
#
# `200` means rewrite — the browser keeps the URL the patient typed or scanned.
# A `301`/`302` here would change the address bar to `/index.html`, which would
# break deep links and the QR codes.
/*    /index.html   200
